      "after": "<h1>关卡03 获取列车通行证，乘坐列车</h1><h1><div style=\"margin: 0px\"><div style=\"margin: 0px\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px\"><img src=\"assets/c33019da5cf966b19a9f22764ea1f2ff15ace55f66d836c4fc76815062404e71.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div style=\"margin: 0px\"><div data-img-block=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px\"><img src=\"assets/8cdaddd51c1591ae2150a81791a5dd124b2d6661065eddc42b44143693b32773.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"border-radius: 3px; text-align: center\"><span style=\"margin: 0px\">JAHI储物柜获取列车通行证（用于车库2楼乘坐地铁）</span><br style=\"margin: 0px\"></div></div></div></div></h1><h2>新一循环，拿上电池（不插电），前往舱段——车库（二楼）</h2><h1><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/7cf0a4d0ad0cea611d27ed720b645d0e7263a0390b666ee58050de22b5d9ca84.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/41f633df9514a3ce82134d87cbf753d5c72e180840a4e890cceafc591f111812.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">前往大厅（二楼）</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/ec9664731556dc8d7a5d39cff9b4ddf541fb51620040a71d5ae9282fa66412cd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/22d35e918abca062ffe3f24f8a2c50a159d4102fcb87b5a12ad6cfc1436a9d58.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">去列车取收容钥匙，列车前往实验室（二楼）</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/db3e15cbbef8d5f0adbf4f6e8f461d9755fde55c20756500e7bfce51067996af.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">右侧放下梯子前往实验室1楼（未断电）</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c6265f0baa0ec0dd5768252584234e99b5b1f6bd97215d7d0ac4220f2917ed01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">容器谜题解法详情见章节《谜题》成就【开锁大师】</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/8a9e7e2b3f7737bedd80e120a45cfd7f1d8646e4b15c508d7f8b1900e8aa5def.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">本循环结束记得把数据卡放在列车上，复制至下一循环</div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2>新一循环，坐列车去大厅（二楼），插入数据卡</h2><h1><div><img src=\"assets/98a5c0e634d3ef0d274aa3a16edfacc8031c8587dd9ef1b7b05cccbc3fc7650c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/727b96dba418c27541851fc87b012208387de69ef15af2a743bb19df137d00fb.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/2ff09272d6fcaee630934864e4551d414e354962935996e7590ed6e8aa4ec29a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>用于车库1楼电脑右侧玩具箱顺序</span></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/765ad44a3826db2088570d37440d4c9cd99a7fc3509a562841d9f25749caba79.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">打开玩具箱，获取魔方</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/70889bf53309f4be8371d4f1adebc60ab57ee144b718d99bc5a1d3d138391a5b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">取下圈中的齿轮（看形状），放在列车，复制至下一循环，再乘列车带回实验室，解开容器谜题（解法见《谜题》章节内成就【开锁大师】），解开后回2楼</div></div><img src=\"assets/44e3d98cf4e25c37d1b07fa3ed6845b633f2bd8df35fe928b03f8eac4defe4e3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/89567d71fa721f2f1006832b00728f5584d4ff05fb4bc5dc52c524d97a107448.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/d3993d159ba3d2babd492c9fe023ebdd3351b7d44f224d01eb209e9e0f5496bd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">去车库1楼黄圈内按照图示步骤，拧魔方，穿越到棚屋</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c7dd1dca1b8f4798cf3ca8a4e942e19c7d7fdca1e746cbcfa5627bf06a7af322.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">获取关卡04 RAFAEL的门禁卡，任意拧动魔方返回</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0c67d990e92d728d19ab060950bbfe86ff83898e70f0f715cdd101c696811ca3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">前往RAFAEL储物柜，更新K9日历/计划系统</div></div></div></div></h1>"
